# CRCKSUM - Calculate and check file checksums

```text
CRCKSUM [options] [filespec ...]
```

## Make a list

The default calculation reports eight check values per file. /LOCAL
writes a list in each selected drive/user. /FILE= writes a single master
list.

```text
B0:CRCKSUM D0:*.COM /LOCAL=CRC.LST
```

## Verify files

```text
B0:CRCKSUM /CHECK D0:
```

Use the same files and algorithm columns for later checks. A mismatch
identifies a changed file. To locate the changed bytes when both copies
are available, use [COMPARE](COMPARE.HLP).
